  "title": "The Three Battles of Panipat",
  "description": "Three battles on one plain north of Delhi: Babur against Ibrahim Lodi in 1526, Akbar’s army against Hemu in 1556, and Ahmad Shah Durrani against the Marathas in 1761, with the marches that led to each and what followed.",
